# Best brain from an LLM brain-lab run (deepseek, 48/16, play-to-death, 64 ticks,
# 6 boards): score 18.67, survival ~497, immortal on 2/6 boards. The LLM's own
# design — two non-interfering layers plus HUNGER-GATED RISK: when hungry
# (temperature high) it amplifies the food drive and eases off body-fear, so it
# hunts harder as starvation nears and plays safe when fed. A real risk/reward
# controller, discovered from game feedback alone.

channel food
channel danger
channel temperature
channel motor
channel avoid

rule hungry_boost:
  when 1
  set motor = food * (1 + 2 * temperature)

rule cautious_avoid:
  when 1
  set avoid = danger * (1 - 0.5 * temperature)
